<title>USA: Urban Shopping underwriter exercises option.</title>
<headline>Urban Shopping underwriter exercises option.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Urban Shopping Centers Inc said Thursday that Lehman Brothers exercised an overallotment option to purchase 225,000 shares of common stock in connection with a recent sale of three million shares of the real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>The net proceeds to Urban from the sale of the additional shares will be $5.6 million. The net proceeds will be used to fund a portion of the previously announced acquisition of Old Orchard Shopping Center and to reduce outstandings under the Company's revolving line of credit, Urban said.</p>
<p>Urban shares rose 1/4 to 28 a share Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
